solution:
**Given:**

frac{5³x⁺⁴ + 125x⁺¹}{125x⁺¹ - 5³x⁺²}

**Formula used:

125 = 5³

(am)ⁿ = amⁿ

am⁺ⁿ = am × aⁿ

Calculation:**

⇒ frac{5³x⁺⁴ + (5³)x⁺¹}{(5³)x⁺¹ - 5³x⁺²}

⇒ frac{5³x⁺⁴ + 5³x⁺³}{5³x⁺³ - 5³x⁺²}

⇒ frac{5³x⁺² times (5² + 5¹)}{5³x⁺² times (5¹ - 5⁰)}

⇒ (25 + 5)/(5 - 1)

⇒ (30)/(4) = 7.5

**∴ The correct answer is option (2).**
